fields.help_en:
The subscription duration of nodes in the node pool. This parameter takes effect and is required only when `instance_charge_type` is set to `PrePaid`.

- When `period_unit=Week`, valid values of `period`: {1, 2, 3, 4}.
- When `period_unit=Month`, valid values of `period`: {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 12, 24, 36, 48, 60}

fields.help_zh:
节点池节点包年包月时长，仅当`instance_charge_type`取值为`PrePaid`时生效，且为必选值。

- 当`period_unit=Week`时，`period`取值范围：{ 1、2、3、4}。
- 当`period_unit=Month`时，`period` 取值范围：{1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8、9、12、24、36、48、60}
